laya-java
Copyright 2026 apscot and laya-java contributors

This product is an independent Java port. It is not an official release of
Convai Innovations, Laya or any related project.

It includes software and design derived from:

  * Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya)
    Copyright Convai Innovations and Laya contributors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
    Token-sequence construction, question rendering, calibration and confidence
    calculations, the decision-head architecture and the output schema follow Laya.

  * laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx), an independent MLX port of Laya.
    Copyright 2026 laya-mlx contributors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
    Used as the numerical reference for parity tests; its calibration clamping
    ([0.5, 5.0]) and result format are reproduced here.

  * The ModernBERT architecture (Hugging Face Transformers, Apache-2.0).

Model weights are NOT included in this repository or in the published artifacts.
They are downloaded at run time from Hugging Face (aac6fef/laya-mlx,
aac6fef/laya-multilingual-mlx, aac6fef/laya-typed-decisions-mlx; originally
convaiinnovations/laya*), each licensed Apache-2.0 by its publisher.
